  Institution: Instituto Superior Tecnico, Universidade de Lisboa
  Country: PT
  Repository: Zenodo
  Data URL: https://zenodo.org/records/7664069
  Publication year: 2022
  Keywords: motor imagery, BCI, brain-computer interface, EEG, virtual reality, haptics, neurorehabilitation

